OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1793370479
OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,FThe Lionesses have extended their
OL,8,Fcontract with manager Sarina Wiegman
OL,9,Fso that she will continue guiding the
OL,10,Fside through the 2029 Euros.
OL,12,FThe new deal means the elite head
OL,13,Fcoach, who has been voted as Fifa's
OL,14,Fbest five times, will have the chance
OL,15,Fto lead the England women's team for a
OL,16,Ffurther two years beyond next summer.
OL,18,F"I am so happy to be able to carry on
OL,19,Fwith this squad and cannot think of a
OL,20,Fbetter job in football," Wiegman said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
