OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,F"Of course, anyone who knows me will
OL,13,Funderstand that my main concern right
OL,14,Fnow is absolutely the World Cup, and
OL,15,Fhelping this squad realise their
OL,16,Fpotential in the years to come," she
OL,17,Fcontinued.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
