PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1793370479
OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,F"We have an important job to do to
OL,8,Fconfirm our place in Brazil, and
OL,9,Fhopefully we can do that and give the
OL,10,Fcountry another special summer to
OL,11,Fremember next year."
OL,13,FWiegman, who is Dutch, has reached
OL,14,Ffive successive major tournament
OL,15,Ffinals including Euro wins with
OL,16,FEngland in 2022 and 2025.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
