OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1793370479
OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,FShe took charge of England in
OL,8,FSeptember 2021, having already won the
OL,9,FEuro with the Netherlands in 2017, and
OL,10,Fagreed a contract extension in January
OL,11,F2024.
OL,13,FIn December, she will lead the
OL,14,FLionesses as they take on Ukraine in
OL,15,Fthe final World Cup play-off round at
OL,16,FWembley Stadium, with the winners
OL,17,Fsecuring their place in the Brazil
OL,18,Ftournament next June.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
