PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1793370479
OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,FThe side will be hoping to go one step
OL,8,Ffurther than the silver medal claimed
OL,9,Fin the 2023 edition, which took place
OL,10,Fin Australia and New Zealand.
OL,12,F"Sarina is an incredible coach, with
OL,13,Fan unparalleled record in major
OL,14,Ftournaments and I am so happy to
OL,15,Fcontinue to work with her for the next
OL,16,FEuro cycle," said Mark Bullingham, CEO
OL,17,Fof the FA.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
