PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1793370479
OL,3,CEngland's Lionesses extend contract
OL,4,Cwith Sarina Wiegman until end of 2029
OL,5,CEuros
OL,7,F"While we will all remember the
OL,8,Ftrophies and thrilling moments she has
OL,9,Fgiven us, I know she is only looking
OL,10,Fforward. There is no one better to
OL,11,Flead the Lionesses into the next two
OL,12,Ftournaments."
